   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">\r\nHi Alan\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>We are working on it. Basically ggplot renamed a parameter. Instead of line width we are still using size. </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>The warning has no effect yet. </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Cheers Bernd<br>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">---------\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\">On 10 Nov 2025, at 15:24, Alan Couch &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">al...@couch.net.au</a>&gt; wrote:<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">﻿Hi all, I recently see this warning message. I cant see that its been discussed before  but sorry if I have missed it.\r\n</div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"auto\"><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(100,72,13);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px\">Warning message</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px\">:\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;color:rgb(8,8,8)\">The `size` argument of `element_rect()` is deprecated as of ggplot2 3.4.0.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;color:rgb(6,152,154)\">ℹ</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;color:rgb(8,8,8)\">\r\n Please use the `linewidth` argument instead.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;color:rgb(6,152,154)\">ℹ</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;color:rgb(8,8,8)\">\r\n The deprecated feature was likely used in the </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;color:rgb(52,101,164)\">dartR.base</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;color:rgb(8,8,8)\">\r\n package.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;color:rgb(8,8,8)\">Please report the issue at\r\n</span><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;color:rgb(52,101,164)\">&lt;</span><a style=\"text-decoration-line:underline;font-style:italic;font-fami